SUMMARY:#dlfLAC-HBCU plenary: welcome and Loretta Parham keynote
DESCRIPTION:We&rsquo;re very pleased to announce Loretta Parham as the distinguished keynoter of this year&rsquo;s DLF Forum liberal arts pre-conference\, which is being organized in partnership with the HBCU Library Alliance\, representing White House-designated Historically Black Colleges and Universities. Please join us for a welcome by Alliance director Sandra Phoenix and for Loretta Parham's talk\, which will examine the theme of &ldquo;Staffing for Our Digital Library: The Promise\, the Plan and Our Response.&rdquo;Watch online: https://forum2017.diglib.org/livestream-recordings/
