SUMMARY:Tour of the Heinz History Museum (Cancelled)
DESCRIPTION:Update: This tour has been cancelled due to low sign-up! The other two Sunday tours\, of the Carnegie Library of Pittsburgh and University of Pittsburgh ULS\, are still on! Check out our Affiliated Events page for more info. If you're in town on Sunday\, join fellow Forum-goers for a tour of the Heinz History Center! Led by a museum docent\, the tour will touch on exhibit highlights and Pittsburgh history. (Visit Mr. Rogers' Neighborhood for us!) The tour includes discounted museum acess for $11\, which you can pay at the DLF Forum registration desk at the Westin before or after the tour (museum is within walking distance of the Westin).Sign up here to attend!
