SUMMARY:closing plenary: #dlfLAC-HBCU reflections and next steps
DESCRIPTION:Join us at our closing plenary for organizing committee members' brief reflections on the day and an open mike\, to contribute your own. We welcome observations\, critiques\, kudos\, hopes\, warnings\, and ideas for future DLF liberal arts/HBCU Library Alliance collaborations! Chelcie Rowell\, who co-chaired last year's Liberal Arts Colleges pre-conference\, will moderate. We'll end with a brief reflection from Sandra Phoenix and a farewell from Bethany Nowviskie. 
