SUMMARY:#m2d: lunch workshop: Resisting Impostor Syndrome
DESCRIPTION:Resisting Impostor SyndromeBess SadlerData Curation Experts\, United States of America Impostor syndrome\, which is particularly common among under-represented groups in technology work and academia\, is the feeling that you aren't qualified for the work you are doing and will be exposed as a fraud. This workshop will lead participants through writing and discussion exercises designed to combat it.Boxed lunches will be available at the session room (including vegetarian\, gluten-free options). Please grab a plate from Allegheny if you have any dietary restrictions!
