SUMMARY:#t0c: working breakfast: Metadata Support Group
DESCRIPTION:Metadata Support Group breakfast sessionJuliet Hardesty(1)\, Anna Neatrour(2)\, Bria Parker(3)\, Liz Woolcott(4)1: University of Indiana; 2: University of Utah; 3: University of Maryland; 4: Utah State University The Metadata Support Group will convene a breakfast session! Join with your fellow members of the Metadata Support Group for breakfast\, networking\, and general metadata discussion. We&rsquo;ll set aside time for you to share your current projects and get feedback from the community with a metadata open mic session!
