SUMMARY:#t4d: lunch workshop: Introduction to Omeka S
DESCRIPTION:Introduction to Omeka SPatrick Murray-JohnRoy Rosenzweig Center for History and New Media\, United States of America Omeka S represents a complete rewrite of Omeka Classic\, adhering to our fundamantal principles of encouraging use of metadata standards\, easy web publishing for cultural heritage organization\, and sharing cultural history. This workshop will introduce Omeka S&rsquo;s features that bring those principles into practical application.Boxed lunches will be available at the session room (including vegetarian\, gluten-free options). Please grab a plate from Allegheny if you have any dietary restrictions!
