SUMMARY:#t5d: Managing Assets as Linked Data with Fedora and the Portland Common Data Model
DESCRIPTION:Managing Assets as Linked Data with Fedora and the Portland Common Data ModelDavid WilcoxDuraSpace\, Canada Fedora is a flexible\, extensible\, open source repository platform for managing\, preserving\, and providing access to digital content. Participants will explore core and extended Fedora features and learn how to create and manage content in Fedora in accordance with linked data best practices and the Portland Common Data Model. 
CATEGORIES:DLF SESSIONS
