SUMMARY:BitCurator Consortium Social Mixer
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for a BitCurator Consortium Social Mixer taking place on Tuesday\, October 24th from 6-8pm at The Yard Market Square in downtown Pittsburgh in conjunction with the 2017 Digital Library Federation Forum and Digital Preservation 2017 conferences (Note: The BCC mixer is not an official DLF event\, and is open to all). The mixer is a fabulous opportunity to talk with colleagues about how they use BitCurator\, digital forensics approaches\, tools\, workflow strategies\, implementation options. Plus we will have stickers! And buttons!  If interested\, please complete the RSVP form so we can get a headcount of possible interest.
