SUMMARY:#w0e: working breakfast: Project Managers
DESCRIPTION:Project Managers Working BreakfastCynthia YorkJohns Hopkins University\, United States of America The Project Managers Group proposes to hold a working breakfast session to engage with project managers on technologies and services that impact the practice of project management in libraries. The Steering Committee will facilitate discussion and present outcomes for ongoing collaboration among project managers throughout the year.
